            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapbar 0.7</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Snapbar now shares anonymous usage data, such as which recording type and options are used, to help decide what to improve. It never includes recordings, file names or window names. You can turn it off in About Snapbar.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
