        <item>
            <title>0.5</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:56:06 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://martinrariga.com</link>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapbar 0.5</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Record your voice: choose a microphone in the new Microphone menu. Pick any connected input, or follow the system default.</li>
  <li>A small level meter next to the recording time moves as you speak, so you can see your microphone is being picked up.</li>
  <li>With Record System Audio on as well, your voice and the system sound are mixed into one track that plays everywhere.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
